The '''Harvest Feast''' is an event that takes place every [[Time Systems|SkyBlock Year]] for {{Green|3}} months between Early Autumn, Autumn, and Late Autumn. During the event, {{Green|4}} crops will be in season: harvesting in-season crops has a chance to drop {{Rare Crops}} and {{Seasoning}}. The crops in season get changed to a different 4 new crops every SkyBlock month (or {{Green|10}} hours and {{Green|20}} minutes). Upcoming in-season crops can be previewed at {{NPCSprite|Feast Chef Ted}}.

{{NPCSprite|Feast Chef Ted}} runs the {{Zone|Communal Stew}} on the [[Hub Island]]. Upon collecting {{Seasoning}}, it will automatically be donated to the Communal Stew and contributes to the player's [[Harvest Feast#Feast Milestones|Feast Milestones]]. [[Harvest Feast#Feast Milestones|Feast Milestones]] reward {{Item|Feast Flask}}s (that can be crafted into the {{Item|Celestial Mason Jar}}), {{Item|Carnival Ticket}}s and a {{Item|Commemorative Mason Jar}} at {{Coll|Harvest Feast Milestone V|nolink=yes}}, or a {{Item|Grand Commemorative Mason Jar}} at {{Coll|Grand Feast Milestone IX|nolink=yes}}.

