Every milestone also grants {{Item|Carnival Ticket|amount=5}}s.

Additionally, the [[Doug#Harvest_Feast|Leftovers]] perk from the [[Carnival]] also grants {{Green|1}}-{{Green|2}} {{Item|Feast Flask}}s if the player reaches the final Milestone.

== Grand Feast ==
While {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}} is in office with the {{AN|Grand Feast}} perk, the '''Harvest Feast''' becomes the '''Grand Feast''' with the following changes:

* The '''Grand Feast''' now runs for an entire [[Time Systems|SkyBlock Year]], with the crops rotating every season as usual.
* {{Kernels}} are obtained by donating {{Seasoning}} to the Communal Stew during a '''Grand Feast''' and by obtaining [[Harvest Feast#Feast Milestones|Feast Milestones]].
* {{NPCSprite|Feast Baker Scott}} appears at the {{Zone|Communal Stew}} to sell exclusive items.
* There are now {{Green|9}} Feast Milestones instead of {{Green|5}}, each milestone also gives {{Kernels}}, and the last milestone grants a {{Item|Grand Commemorative Mason Jar}}.

== Rare Crops ==
While harvesting crops that are in-season, there is a {{Chance|0.006%|1|18,000}} chance for '''Harvest Feast''' [[Rare Crops]] to drop. [[Pests]] that drop in-season crops have a {{Chance|15%|1|6.67}} chance to drop their respective '''Rare Crop'''. {{MobSprite|Field Mouse}} has a {{Chance|30%|1|3.33}} to drop any in-season crop.

{{Seasoning}}, despite being classified as a [[Rare Crop]], has a {{Chance|0.04%|1|2,250}} chance to drop and does not appear as a physical item.

{{stat|overbloom}} increases the chance to drop [[Rare Crops]].

